    <span class="eyebrow">Exams and results</span>
    <h1>Result cards that agree with the marksheet</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;max-width:62ch">
      Marks go in once, per paper, by the teacher who marked them. Everything
      printed afterwards, the card, the tabulation sheet, the positions, is
      computed from that one set of numbers, so the three cannot disagree.
    </p>
